x"},{"c":"NVO 2018 Q2","e":"nvo","d":"2018-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lars Jorgensen","x":"What exactly do you expect to get out of making two list price increases while you still see net prices going down and still -- and run the risk of what I will call a Twitter shitstorm if somebody would notice?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/10/novo-nordisk-nvo-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2018 Q2","e":"nvo","d":"2018-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lars Jorgensen","x":"The price increase, I'll start off with that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/10/novo-nordisk-nvo-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2018 Q2","e":"nvo","d":"2018-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lars Jorgensen","x":"And I think there's a lot of talk about layoffs, etc. We're not, as you have seen, announcing a bit -- big layoff round today, but we are going to make a number of changes that, in a number of areas, will lead to less people.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/10/novo-nordisk-nvo-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2018 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"The operating profit growth was negatively impacted by severance cost in the third quarter of 2018 and the adjusted operating profit was 4% in local currencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2018 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Karsten Munk Knudsen","x":"Operating profit was negatively impacted by around DKK600 million in severance costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2018 Q4","e":"nvo","d":"2019-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"Operating profit was negatively impacted by severance costs related to the layoffs in the second half of 2018 and the expensed priority review vouch before the filing of oral semaglutide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/02/novo-nordisk-nvo-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2018 Q4","e":"nvo","d":"2019-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Karsten Munk Knudsen","x":"The increased costs are impacted by the expense priority review voucher for the oral semaglutide filing and severance costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/02/novo-nordisk-nvo-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2019 Q1","e":"nvo","d":"2019-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"So correct me if I understood you wrongly, but your question was about the proposed rule of passing through a rebate in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2019 Q1","e":"nvo","d":"2019-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"I tend to believe that the pass-through of rebate reform will happen, but I also note that it's not a simple thing to change.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2019 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2019-11-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Camilla Sylvest","x":"And that also means that the market is yet not mature enough for us to do direct to consumer marketing because of the barriers that we still see in the system.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2019 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2019-11-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Camilla Sylvest","x":"And I think the question also went to whether we would do a DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2019 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2019-11-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Camilla Sylvest","x":"And when we have gotten more mature in both of these areas, so patients seeking care and providers being able to provide the care, then the market will be more mature for DTC activities, but not at this point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2019 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2019-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karsten Munk Knudsen","x":"The only slight delta is explained by timing of list price increases between the years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2019 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2019-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"So on GLP-1 price and ability to take a price increase, I do not really want to comment on that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2019 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2019-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Karsten Munk Knudsen","x":"In terms of operating profit growth and items in the comparator base, then do recall that in Q4 last year, we expensed a priority review voucher that we used for Rybelsus and then we had some severance costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2020 Q2","e":"nvo","d":"2020-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"The recent executive orders, two of them deal will increased pass-through rebates to patients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"NVO 2020 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2020-10-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"Furthermore, more than 80% of new prescriptions are new to the GLP-1 class and direct-to-consumer advertisement has begun.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"NVO 2020 Q3","e":"nvo","d":"2020-10-30","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Camilla Sylvest","x":"And then on 21st of September, we launched our new DTC campaign, wake up to the possibilities with Rybelsus and we saw that there was an immediate increase to visit on our rybelsus.com website following this.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"NVO 2020 Q4","e":"nvo","d":"2021-02-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"Furthermore, the 80% of new prescriptions are new to GLP-1 class with direct-to-consumer advertisement continuing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"NVO 2021 Q1","e":"nvo","d":"2021-05-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Karsten Munk Knudsen","x":"So, we're basically running parallel DTC campaigns behind the brands.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"NVO 2021 Q1","e":"nvo","d":"2021-05-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Karsten Munk Knudsen","x":"But more granularity in terms of the phasing, I would not want to give at this point in time because that also indicates some of our commercial tactics vis-a-vis, for instance, DTC programs in the US.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/novo-nordisk-as-nvo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"NVO 2021 Q1","e":"nvo","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lars Fruergaard Jorgensen","x":"The solid financial performance in